    {
      "id": "claim_2bb17f47371446ef9c4ee40628d10d17",
      "statement": "ComparisonPageBuilder.build is a library-only API that assembles the written metrics.json, the slice-grid PNGs and optional Lightning metrics.csv series (val/fid, val/mean_reward) into one self-contained HTML page with base64 PNG data URIs and no external image, stylesheet or script dependencies; when no ControlNet eval directory is supplied it renders a clearly marked pending slot instead of inventing a comparison, and it is deliberately not registered as a console command.",
