      "statement": "The public manifold.eval barrel exports BeforeAfterEval, BeforeAfterResult, SliceGrid, ComparisonPageBuilder, JitComparison and ControlNetComparison, and the only shipped console surface of the eval subsystem is manifold-eval (manifold.eval.cli:main); the in-training paired-fidelity monitor is not a console surface but a Lightning callback reached through manifold-train-controlnet.",
