    {
      "id": "claim_3deec0db7fdf43819901cd4d45bf91c9",
      "statement": "The observe-only in-training paired-fidelity monitor is implemented and on by default for the supervised ControlNet stage (ADR-0037, issue #238): PairedFidelityCallback in src/manifold/metrics/paired_callback.py is built by the registry spec PairedFidelitySpec in src/manifold/training/callbacks/paired_fidelity.py, and manifold-train-controlnet registers the name paired_fidelity and includes it in the shell's default callback list [\"train_loss\", \"checkpoint\", \"paired_fidelity\"].",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/metrics/paired_callback.py#L1-L40",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:07b2ab0712af19e7ff78d3bc583a21c78ebf76f7e3cb5777709812f6cffe8050:"
