        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a33b84ea01bc4dac9c238936ed52ec46",
      "statement": "The in-training monitor's numbers are comparable to the offline before/after number because it reuses the same metric (PairedFidelityMetrics), the same per-sample normalization (min_max_to_unit) and the same full-rollout generation rather than a single-step x0-decode proxy, and it stages the VAE through the same VaeStage helper the FID VramStage composes.",
