        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_446840ca19134e76a45d2761e7002b2f",
      "statement": "manifold-train-grpo does not register the paired-fidelity monitor (its registry holds only train_loss, fid and checkpoint), and on the ControlNet policy path it force-removes fid after the merge through TrainingSpine's forbidden_callbacks / forbidden_monitors because the unconditional FID rollout ignores the ControlNet; ADR-0037 treats the GRPO-stage extension as an explicit follow-up that means releasing the blanket FID ban for this callback only, since paired fidelity rolls the trainable ControlNet.",
      "evidence": [
